1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
The plant produces flowers to enable reproduction.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Flowers contain the reproductive organs needed for pollination.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Bees and other insects help transfer pollen between flowers.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
After pollination, the flower will develop into seeds for new plants.
